{
  "id": "RAW_aad72c7ab3",
  "title": "41 分钟卷走 7000 万美元比特币，Coldcard 漏洞被指牵涉其中",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NjA0NjgyMA==&mid=2651343827&idx=1&sn=7ae5200683fcbb26437066a5e258a897",
  "date": "2026-08-02 18:00:00",
  "author": "FreeBuf",
  "siteName": "FreeBuf",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span>FreeBuf</span> <span>2026-08-02 18:00</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">上海</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260802191750_175d099.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>Coldcard硬件钱包弱随机数漏洞致7000万美元比特币被盗。</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"FreeBuf\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.1328125\" data-w=\"640\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260802191750_3995892.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icBE3OpK1IX1QQMvANpKeiagLibt8v4VM7ahGtwG0PIRupv5Smibgg1Sib1icsKEO6t26X5xKzTNb0ffiayeAiaKVXlFNKFAxA2KydyAQ431UX388qU/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"823\" data-imgfileid=\"503860178\" data-ratio=\"1.5076045627376427\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1052\" data-type=\"png\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260802191750_db4f1c2.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:4px 0 16px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">41分钟扫荡1,196个地址</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">7月30日，一名攻击者在41分钟内清空了1,196个比特币地址，盗走1,082.65 BTC，按当时价格计算价值约7020万美元。Galaxy Research对此次扫荡进行了链上测绘，并将其与加拿大公司Coinkite旗下比特币专用硬件钱包Coldcard的一个固件漏洞关联起来。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">2021年3月的一次固件集成错误，将种子生成流程导向了确定性的软件PRNG（伪随机数生成器），而非STM32硬件RNG（随机数生成器）。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img alt=\"Coldcard硬件钱包漏洞\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5217391304347826\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-w=\"690\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260802191750_138146d.jpeg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Block表示，攻击者只要能确定或充分限定设备UID、定时器状态以及此前的RNG调用历史，就无需接触设备即可离线重现候选输出流。随后可通过派生地址并与公开区块链数据比对，来验证候选种子。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"2\" data-imgfileid=\"503860173\" data-ratio=\"1.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260802191750_d43f6ea.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:4px 0 16px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">漏洞根源、紧急修复与受影响版本</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">7月31日，Coinkite为所有受影响型号和发布通道推送了紧急固件，但安装该固件并不能修复已有的种子。Coinkite敦促种子已暴露的用户在打过补丁的固件上生成新种子，并转移他们的币。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">将旧种子恢复到更新后的固件或另一款钱包中，会继续保留这一弱点。目前尚无公开报告成功重建受害者的种子并匹配到被清空的地址。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Block将问题追溯至Coldcard的生产配置。该配置将MICROPY_HW_ENABLE_RNG定义为0，原因是Coinkite提供了自有的硬件RNG封装。libngu库只检查该宏是否存在，而不检查其是否启用，从而将构建绑定到了MicroPython的Yasmarang备用方案。该备用方案由芯片唯一ID和定时器寄存器初始化，且在初始化之后不再收集新的熵。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Coinkite估计，Mk3的有效熵约为40位，Mk4、Mk5和Q约为72位，而12个单词的BIP-39种子对应128位熵。Block并未给出一个实际数字，仅设定了低于2^40.7和2^73.3的条件上限，并警告后者并不等同于73位的密码学安全强度。Block也未公布暴力破解基准测试。</span></p>\n  <p nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"Galaxy Research链上测绘\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-ratio=\"0.5594202898550724\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-w=\"690\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260802191750_501e576.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">较新型号的重新播种会增加候选数量，但Block表示，实际操作成本取决于可用的UID信息、启动时序、先前的RNG调用以及派生成本。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">是否受影响取决于创建种子时运行的固件版本，而非当前安装的版本：</span></p>\n  <ul style=\"margin:8px 0;padding:0 32px;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n   <li style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;margin:4px 0;list-style:disc;word-break:break-all;\">\n    <p><span leaf=\"\">Mk2和Mk3：Coinkite列出的Mk3受影响版本为4.0.1至4.1.9，在4.2.0中修复，但未提及Mk2。Block将Mk2和Mk3的4.0.0至4.1.9版本均列为受影响范围。</span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;margin:4px 0;list-style:disc;word-break:break-all;\">\n    <p><span leaf=\"\">Mk4和Mk5：5.6.0之前的所有版本。</span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;margin:4px 0;list-style:disc;word-break:break-all;\">\n    <p><span leaf=\"\">Q：1.5.0Q之前的所有版本。</span></p>\n   </li>\n   <li style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;margin:4px 0;list-style:disc;word-break:break-all;\">\n    <p><span leaf=\"\">Edge构建版本：Mk4和Mk5为6.6.0X之前，Q为6.6.0QX之前。</span></p>\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">03</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:4px 0 16px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">缓解措施与调查进展</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Coinkite表示，使用至少50次公平、独立且私密的掷骰子结果生成的种子，不会仅因该漏洞而处于风险之中。如果掷骰子的次数或私密性无法确定，Coinkite建议进行迁移。一个强且唯一的BIP-39口令可以创建独立钱包，仅凭种子词无法访问该钱包，但公司仍建议更换种子。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">多签只有在所需签名数量并非完全由受影响设备构成时才有帮助。TAPSIGNER、OPENDIME和SATSCARD使用不同的代码库，不受影响。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">目前还没有人指认攻击者的身份。绘制了1,196个地址扫荡链路的Galaxy表示，在过去30天内未发现其他具有相同30 sat/vB、无找零特征的比特币交易。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Galaxy警告称，该模式只能识别操作者，而不能识别盗窃行为，因为这种扫荡“与币主选择自行转币时的表现并无二致”。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">此次披露之前，Coinspect于7月初发布了Ill Bloom研究，该研究揭示了旧版软件钱包中另一个独立的弱PRNG漏洞，该漏洞与自5月以来从比特币、以太坊、Tron、Rootstock和Polygon上的地址中被卷走的超过500万美元资金有关。</span></p>\n  <div style=\"margin:24px 16px 0 16px;padding:12px 16px;border-left:3px solid #cccccc;background:#f9f9f9;\">\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0 0 8px 0;line-height:1.6;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">参考来源：</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0 0 4px 0;line-height:1.6;font-weight:bold;\"><span leaf=\"\">Coldcard Hardware Wallet Flaw Linked to $70 Million Bitcoin Theft in 41 Minutes</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0;line-height:1.6;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://thehackernews.com/2026/08/coldcard-hardware-wallet-flaw-linked-to.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://thehackernews.com/2026/08/coldcard-hardware-wallet-flaw-linked-to.html</a></span></p>\n  </div>\n  <div data-v-54ed4ede=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;margin: 0px;padding: 15px 0px 0px;border: 0px;text-decoration: none;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-variant-numeric: inherit;font-variant-east-asian: inherit;font-variant-alternates: inherit;font-variant-position: inherit;font-variant-emoji: inherit;font-weight: 400;font-stretch: inherit;font-size: medium;line-height: inherit;font-optical-sizing: inherit;font-size-adjust: inherit;font-kerning: inherit;font-feature-settings: inherit;font-variation-settings: inherit;font-language-override: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, PingFangSC;outline: none;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;\" data-pm-slice=\"6 2 []\">\n   <div data-pm-slice=\"4 2 []\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 黑体, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;pointer-events: initial;\">\n    <div data-pm-slice=\"7 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;6 1 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;2 1 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\">\n     <div data-pm-slice=\"6 1 []\">\n      <div data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\">\n       <div>\n        <div data-pm-slice=\"8 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 黑体, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;pointer-events: initial;\">\n         <div data-pm-slice=\"9 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;\">\n          <div data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;\">\n           <div data-pm-slice=\"5 3 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;8 1 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;9 1 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;2 1 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;text-align: right;\">\n            <div data-pm-slice=\"4 2 []\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 黑体, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;pointer-events: initial;\">\n             <div data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\">\n              <p data-pm-slice=\"16 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 黑体, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;pointer-events: initial;\"></p>\n              <h3 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"display: block;margin: 0px 16px;padding: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;max-width: 100%;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: right;line-height: 1.75em;pointer-events: initial;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-seri